  "question": {
    "text": "A particle oscillates along the $x$-axis according to the law, $x(\\mathrm{t})=x_0 \\sin ^2\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{t}}{2}\\right)$ where $x_0=1 \\mathrm{~m}$. The kinetic energy $(\\mathrm{K})$ of the particle as a function of $x$ is correctly represented by the graph"
