  "solution": {
    "text": "$x(t)=x_0 \\sin ^2\\left(\\frac{t}{2}\\right)=\\frac{x_0}{2}(1-\\cos t)$\n<img src=\"assets\\st0015_715cc827d2e1.png\"><br>\nClearly $\\frac{x_0}{2}$ is mean position.<img src=\"assets\\st0015_7c1991ddbc9a.png\"><br>"
